<title>POLAND: LUBAWA JULY NET FLAT AT PLN 0.2 MLN.</title>
<headline>LUBAWA JULY NET FLAT AT PLN 0.2 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results July</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> JULY		     1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.19 vs   0.19</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.25 vs   0.33</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.32 vs   0.34</p>
<p> Sales		    2.48 vs   2.47</p>
<p> JANUARY-JULY	   1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     2.13 vs   1.23</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 3.37 vs   2.12</p>
<p> Operating profit     1.82 vs   2.34</p>
<p> Sales		   18.04 vs  17.77</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish technical garment maker is</p>
<p>Lubawa SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
